<!--
  The small icon of the drive notification (位置情報を使用中), shown in the
  status bar and in the notification shade for as long as a drive runs.

  Android draws a status bar icon from its alpha channel only, so this is a
  white silhouette on a transparent ground: 24dp, the glyph centred and
  spanning 0.98 to 23.02 of the 24 units, where the font places it.

  The shape is the location glyph this app already draws on its
  現在地に戻る control (Icons.my_location): the outline of U+E418 in the
  MaterialIcons-Regular.otf that Flutter ships, scaled from 512 font units to
  this 24-unit viewport and flipped to y-down. The app has no artwork of its
  own to derive from: its launcher icon is still Flutter's template.

  Material Icons by Google, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes: the one glyph,
  rescaled, reflected vertically and filled white.

  geolocator finds this drawable by name at run time, so nothing in the APK
  refers to it; res/raw/keep.xml keeps it through release resource shrinking.
-->
